ight_bonus\" title=\"Insight bonus\">Insight bonus</a> to Saves.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Blurry\" title=\"Blurry\">Blurry</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Blurry\" title=\"Blurry\">Blurry</a>:</b> Equipping this item causes you to become slightly blurry. Attacks from enemies have a 20% chance to miss you due to concealment.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Deathblock\" title=\"Deathblock\">Deathblock IX</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Deathblock\" title=\"Deathblock\">Deathblock IX</a>:</b> Passive: 27% <a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">Enhancement Bonus</a> to <a href=\"/page/Negative_Energy_Absorption\" title=\"Negative Energy Absorption\">Negative Energy Absorption</a>. In addition, you are immune to magical effects that can cause instant death.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Angelic_Grace\" title=\"Angelic Grace\">Angelic Grace</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=